 \qquad P_\kappa=\frac{\kappa\otimes\kappa}{|\kappa|^2}, \tag{5.4}
\end{equation}$$ the projection of the vector at the origin onto the plane perpendicular to $\kappa(t_0,a)$. It is even in $a$.

